    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_START "Start Scrollshot"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_HELP "Tips for scrolling screenshots"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_HELP_TITLE "Scrolling screenshot"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_HELP_BODY "Easnap joins everything that passes through the frame into one tall image.\n\n- Press Start, then scroll the content inside the frame with the wheel, the keyboard or its scrollbar.\n- Scroll at a steady pace. If Easnap loses track, scroll back up a little and continue.\n- A fixed header or footer is kept once. The mouse pointer is never part of the image.\n- Finish with Copy (Enter or Ctrl+C), Save (Ctrl+S) or Edit. Esc discards.\n- The shortcuts work while Easnap has the keyboard focus; the capture shortcut brings it back."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_HELP_WHEEL "\n\nOn this computer Windows sends the wheel to the active window only. Click inside the frame once before scrolling, or turn on ""Scroll inactive windows when I hover over them"" in the Windows mouse settings."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_TOOL "Scrolling screenshot"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_TOOL_FIXED "Scrolling screenshot (not available once the screenshot is taken)"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_EDIT "Edit"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_SAVE "Save (Ctrl+S)"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_DISCARD "Discard (Esc)"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_COPY "Copy to clipboard (Enter)"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_SIZE "%1 × %2"
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_SCROLL "Scroll the content inside the frame."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_LOST "Easnap lost track. Scroll back up a little, then continue."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_LIMIT "Maximum length reached. Copy, save or edit the image."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_CAPTURE_FAILED "This area cannot be captured any more. What was captured is kept."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_DISPLAY_CHANGED "The display changed, so capture stopped. Your image is kept."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_WHEEL "The wheel goes to the active window. Click inside the frame once, then scroll."
    IDS_SCROLLSHOT_STATUS_STOPPING "Still finishing the capture. Try again in a moment."
